# Keep local installs, build output, VCS state, and secrets out of every image
# build context: host node_modules would clobber the in-container install
# (darwin binaries over linux), and .env files must never reach image layers —
# `pnpm deploy` in apps/backend/Dockerfile copies the whole project directory
# into the final runner stage, so anything admitted here can ship in the image.
**/node_modules
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!apps/testing/.env.test.example
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
.temp
.claude
